{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-tracker-services-2-b-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"gap-8","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-635","F-phone-607"],"severity":"S3","title":"A deleted workout can leave its personal records behind, with no note","what":"Before deleting a workout, the app reads which exercises it held so it can redo their records. If that read fails, it quietly uses an empty list: the workout is deleted, but its saved record rows (which are not removed with the workout) are never redone, and the result even says records are up to date. The coach and anything else reading the saved records can keep showing a record from a workout that no longer exists.","expected":"If the app cannot tell which records to redo, it notes the failure and redoes them later (or redoes all records), and never reports them as up to date.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/workoutDelete.ts:54-71","apps/mobile/src/db/schema.ts:68-77"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"delete-skips-records-on-read-fail","who":"members","how_often":"rare","fix_line":"On a failed read, mark records to catch up and log it instead of using an empty list","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-tracker-services-2-b-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"gap-8","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-601","F-phone-603"],"severity":"S4","title":"Removing a progress photo or the profile photo can leave the picture on the phone, unnoticed","what":"Removing a progress photo or the profile photo takes it off the screen first, then deletes the picture file and its backup copy. Any failure to delete a file is swallowed with no note, so the private picture can stay in the app's storage while the member believes it is gone.","expected":"A file that could not be deleted is noted and retried later, so a removed photo really leaves the phone.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/progressPhotos.ts:188-196","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/profilePhoto.ts:100-104","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/profilePhoto.ts:55-56"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"photo-file-delete-failure-silent","who":"members","how_often":"rare","fix_line":"Log a failed file delete and retry it in the start-up sweep","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
